  "body": "The upper panic room now has a large physical wall button labelled \"Panik odasını kilitle\", with a blinking red alarm above it. The interaction marker moves to the actual wall. Grounded/floor/ray/controller admission gates remain required; the existing phase transition after successful E interaction is retained. 90+40 seconds, 1500 starting budget, 75% loss threshold, cost/cancel/controller/stock/RNG/score rules and the prior V5.13-r7 features remain intact.\r\n\r\nWindows64 portable ZIP. Extract fully and run TooLateToPanic.exe.\r\nYeni Editor kontrolü NOT_RUN; 122 aynı DLL native API/render kontrolü, 15 incelenmiş kare. OS girdisi/insan oynanış, okunurluk, dinleme, konfor ve tam kampanya kabulü NOT_RUN. Dedicated current-DLL API/render smoke uses declared fixtures. Previous V5.13 broad native/retained/fullscreen results are not transferred. Prerelease pending user playtest.\r\n\r\nThe wall button, blinking red alarm, related code, Turkish text and checks used OpenAI Codex. No new external visual/model/shader/audio, provider credit or payment. Existing licenses/provenance, old published releases/tags/assets and stable v0.4.13 are preserved. No competition form submission.\r\n"
